{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958210/extras/b11c588a13a38e6f221612dbdb3cdc5f.avif?t=1765041173\" width=406 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connie and the Essence of Chaos</strong> is an upcoming indie 2D platformer. It's inspired by some of my favourite 2D platformers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you control our limbless hero <strong>Connie</strong> and her spirit friend <strong>Plum</strong> on their quest to defeat <strong>Lucilate</strong>, an evil overlord who has taken over the island of <strong>Cuisinia</strong>. Explore a whimsical world, free every imprisoned essence spirit, unlock new powers and beat up a bunch of terrifying foes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm still working on the game but I'm hoping to release it in 2026. In the meantime you can add it to your <strong>WISHLIST</strong> and follow <strong>UPDATES</strong> I will be posting here, on my website and on Youtube. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find the link to my website on the side of the store page. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958210/extras/3ba4eca7bb43ff969483286a17807980.avif?t=1765041173\" width=218 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2958210?t=1765041173","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765041173","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958210/943fcb11277ccc156ec6e8e032b10e21ff176074/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765041173","capsule_imagev